modversion=0.1.0
versionMin=42.0.0
description=Your own key for the map symbols. Pick a vanilla symbol and a pen colour, say what it means (type it or choose from presets like Horde, Cleared, Loot or Water) and it shows in a legend in the bottom-left corner of the world map, with how many of each are on the map. The same symbol in another colour is another entry, so a red X can mean Horde and a green X Cleared. Hover a row to outline those symbols on the map, click it to keep them outlined. In the symbols panel, picking a symbol switches to its legend colour and the tooltip says what it means. The legend is saved to your profile and shared by every save, and any character can keep its own instead.
